<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0388_R35R0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">’Scuse me, youngblood!\nI got a letter from my homie.\rI wrote a reply. Took me six weeks.\nI don’t write good.\rI can’t leave this gate. I’m on house\narrest. Long story.\rHe on Route 31. Can you help? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0388_R35R0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh... Never mind, then...\nYou busy. Everybody busy. I’m stuck.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0388_R35R0101_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Huh?\nYour crew full!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0388_R35R0101_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sheesh, good looks!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0388_R35R0101_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} got the\nSPEAROW with Mail!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0388_R35R0101_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My homie on Route 31.\rHe the one who look OBVIOUSLY hype to\nread letters. You’ll know. He sleep.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0388_R35R0101_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My homie on Route 31.\rOh, yeah.\nThere was a weird tree\fblockin’ the road.\fI wonder if it got cleared?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0388_R35R0101_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Good looks for the delivery!\r...A cave exploration?\nAh, you can go right through here.\rI want you to have this for\nbein’ so solid!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0388_R35R0101_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My dawg was sleep, right?\nHeh, he ALWAYS sleep. Narcolepsy.\fOr he lazy. Can’t tell.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0388_R35R0101_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">WHAT?! You LOST the Mail?!\rSix weeks... Six WEEKS...\nOh well. That’s OK. Don’t trip.\fI’m trippin’ a lil.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0388_R35R0101_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Everything good!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0388_R35R0101_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A weird tree blockin’ the road.\rIt WIGGLE when you talk to it. I\ntalked to it for a hour. It’s a good\flistener.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0388_R35R0101_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I love the Homie Lullaby on the radio.\nPut me RIGHT out.\fI was drivin’.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0388_R35R0101_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I can’t believe a lil tweak turn the\nPokégear into a radio!\rYour Pokégear ain’t got that yet?\nTragic.\rThey givin’ quizzes at the Radio Tower\nfront desk on the first floor.\rGet ’em right and you get the Radio\nCard! It’s like school but you win\fstuff!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0388_R35R0101_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I might not look it, but I’m GOOD with\ntech. I fixed my microwave once.\rWanna know how to listen to the radio?\n{YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0388_R35R0101_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Open your Pokégear and hit the\nradio button. Then you see the\fscreen for tunin’ in.\rThe middle of the screen is the\nradio map.\rMove the blinkin’ mark around\nthe map to tune in to different\fradio shows.\rIf that’s too much work, there’s\nfour channels, two on each\fside, for easy tunin’.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0388_R35R0101_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Was I bein’ a backseat driver?\nMy wife say I do that. In the house.</language>
	</row>
</body>
